sequenceDiagram
    actor Merchant as 商家管理员
    actor User as 普通用户
    participant MerchantUI as MerchantOrders
    participant UserUI as Orders
    participant API as frontend/src/api.ts
    participant Sec as SecurityConfig
    participant Ctrl as ApiControllers
    participant Admin as MerchantAdminService
    participant Order as OrderWorkflowService
    participant Store as DemoStore
    Merchant->>MerchantUI: 查看本店待履约订单
    MerchantUI->>API: GET /merchant-admin/orders
    API->>Sec: 携带商家 Token
    Sec->>Ctrl: 校验 MERCHANT_ADMIN
    Ctrl->>Admin: merchantOrders(current)
    Admin->>Store: 读取本店订单
    Store-->>MerchantUI: 返回订单与时间线
    Merchant->>MerchantUI: 接单/配送/完成
    MerchantUI->>API: POST /merchant-admin/orders/{id}/transition
    API->>Ctrl: 提交目标状态
    Ctrl->>Admin: transition(current,id,next)
    Admin->>Store: 校验归属与相邻状态并写入时间线
    User->>UserUI: 确认收货并评价
    UserUI->>API: POST /orders/{id}/receive；POST /reviews
    API->>Sec: 携带用户 Token
    Sec->>Ctrl: 校验 USER
    Ctrl->>Order: receive/review(current,...)
    Order->>Store: 校验订单归属并保存 RECEIVED/Review
    Store-->>UserUI: 返回收货和评价结果
    alt 越权、非法状态或重复评价
        Ctrl-->>MerchantUI: 返回 403/409，状态不变
    end
